
# Retrieve Person Invalid Parent Notes: Test Suite #01 (Single Parent)
#
# Test suite contruction rules:
#
# 1. The proband is always a Person Resource (gx:Person) with a valid gender specification.
# 2. The proband participates in exactly two gx:ParentChild relationships with both parents
#    (parent1 and parent2).
# 3. A parent state is Stubbed, Untyped, or Typed.
# 4. A parent gender is Unknown1, Invalid, or Valid
#
# For the definition of Unknown, Invalid, and Valid gender see model-01_single-parent.ttl file.
#
# Variant Summary Table:
#
# +---------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
# |         | Parent 1            | Parent 2            |
# +---------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
# | Variant | State    | Gender   | State    | Gender   |
# +---------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
# | V201    | Stubbed  | N/A      | Stubbed  | N/A      | stubbed(1), stubbed(2)
# | V202    | Stubbed  | N/A      | Untyped  | Unknown1 | stubbed(1), untyped(2), unknown(2)
# | V203    | Stubbed  | N/A      | Untyped  | Invalid  | stubbed(1), untyped(2), invalid(2)
# | V204    | Stubbed  | N/A      | Untyped  | Valid    | stubbed(1), untyped(2)
# | V205    | Stubbed  | N/A      | Typed    | Unknown1 | stubbed(1), unknown(2)
# | V206    | Stubbed  | N/A      | Typed    | Invalid  | stubbed(1), invalid(2)
# | V207    | Stubbed  | N/A      | Typed    | Valid    | stubbed(1),
# +---------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
# | ----    | Untyped  | Unknown1 | Stubbed  | N/A      | untyped(1), unknown(1), stubbed(2)
# | V208    | Untyped  | Unknown1 | Untyped  | Unknown1 | untyped(1), unknown(1), untyped(2), unknown(2)
# | V209    | Untyped  | Unknown1 | Untyped  | Invalid  | untyped(1), unknown(1), untyped(2), invalid(2)
# | V210    | Untyped  | Unknown1 | Untyped  | Valid    | untyped(1), unknown(1), untyped(2)
# | V211    | Untyped  | Unknown1 | Typed    | Unknown1 | untyped(1), unknown(1), unknown(2)
# | V212    | Untyped  | Unknown1 | Typed    | Invalid  | untyped(1), unknown(1), invalid(2)
# | V213    | Untyped  | Unknown1 | Typed    | Valid    | untyped(1), unknown(1),
# +---------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
# | ----    | Untyped  | Invalid  | Stubbed  | N/A      | untyped(1), invalid(1), stubbed(2)
# | ----    | Untyped  | Invalid  | Untyped  | Unknown1 | untyped(1), invalid(1), untyped(2), unknown(2)
# | V214    | Untyped  | Invalid  | Untyped  | Invalid  | untyped(1), invalid(1), untyped(2), invalid(2)
# | V215    | Untyped  | Invalid  | Untyped  | Valid    | untyped(1), invalid(1), untyped(2)
# | V216    | Untyped  | Invalid  | Typed    | Unknown1 | untyped(1), invalid(1), unknown(2)
# | V217    | Untyped  | Invalid  | Typed    | Invalid  | untyped(1), invalid(1), invalid(2)
# | V218    | Untyped  | Invalid  | Typed    | Valid    | untyped(1), invalid(1),
# +---------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
# | ----    | Untyped  | Valid    | Stubbed  | N/A      | untyped(1), stubbed(2)
# | ----    | Untyped  | Valid    | Untyped  | Unknown1 | untyped(1), untyped(2), unknown(2)
# | ----    | Untyped  | Valid    | Untyped  | Invalid  | untyped(1), untyped(2), invalid(2)
# | V219    | Untyped  | Valid    | Untyped  | Valid    | untyped(1), untyped(2)
# | V220    | Untyped  | Valid    | Typed    | Unknown1 | untyped(1), unknown(2)
# | V221    | Untyped  | Valid    | Typed    | Invalid  | untyped(1), invalid(2)
# | V222    | Untyped  | Valid    | Typed    | Valid    | untyped(1),
# +---------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
# | ----    | Typed    | Unknown1 | Stubbed  | N/A      | unknown(1), stubbed(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Unknown1 | Untyped  | Unknown1 | unknown(1), untyped(2), unknown(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Unknown1 | Untyped  | Invalid  | unknown(1), untyped(2), invalid(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Unknown1 | Untyped  | Valid    | unknown(1), untyped(2)
# | V223    | Typed    | Unknown1 | Typed    | Unknown1 | unknown(1), unknown(2)
# | V224    | Typed    | Unknown1 | Typed    | Invalid  | unknown(1), invalid(2)
# | V225    | Typed    | Unknown1 | Typed    | Valid    | unknown(1),
# +---------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
# | ----    | Typed    | Invalid  | Stubbed  | N/A      | invalid(1), stubbed(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Invalid  | Untyped  | Unknown1 | invalid(1), untyped(2), unknown(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Invalid  | Untyped  | Invalid  | invalid(1), untyped(2), invalid(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Invalid  | Untyped  | Valid    | invalid(1), untyped(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Invalid  | Typed    | Unknown1 | invalid(1), unknown(2)
# | V226    | Typed    | Invalid  | Typed    | Invalid  | invalid(1), invalid(2)
# | V227    | Typed    | Invalid  | Typed    | Valid    | invalid(1),
# +---------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
# | ----    | Typed    | Valid    | Stubbed  | N/A      | stubbed(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Valid    | Untyped  | Unknown1 | untyped(2), unknown(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Valid    | Untyped  | Invalid  | untyped(2), invalid(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Valid    | Untyped  | Valid    | untyped(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Valid    | Typed    | Unknown1 | unknown(2)
# | ----    | Typed    | Valid    | Typed    | Invalid  | invalid(2)
# | V228    | Typed    | Valid    | Typed    | Valid    |
# +---------+----------+----------+----------+----------+
#
# Validity Notes Legend
# * stubbed(X) - Stubbed Parent X
# * untyped(X) - Untyped Parent X
# * unknown(X) - Unknown Gender of Parent X
# * invalid(X) - Invalid Gender of Parent X

@prefix gx:  <http://gedcomx.org/> .
@prefix ex:  <http://example.org/> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

######################################################################
# V201: Parent1=Stubbed; Gender=N/A; Parent2=Stubbed; Gender=N/A
######################################################################
ex:V201P1 a gx:Person ;
    gx:gender [ a gx:Gender ; gx:type gx:Female ] .

# ex:V201P2 is Stubbed (referenced only in the ParentChild relationship)
ex:V201R1 a gx:Relationship ;
    gx:type gx:ParentChild ;
    gx:person1 ex:V201P2 ;
    gx:person2 ex:V201P1 .

# ex:V201P3 is Stubbed (referenced only in the ParentChild relationship)
ex:V201R2 a gx:Relationship ;
    gx:type gx:ParentChild ;
    gx:person1 ex:V201P3 ;
    gx:person2 ex:V201P1 .

